WEBVTT

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.630
4 warriors

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:38.010
And in 2011, the universe seemed to have regained its peace.

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:42.680
But...

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:13.760
We, the Mother Computers, Vector Sigma,

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:16.500
are now releasing the Sabertron to the Decepticons and Cybertrons.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.820
We are the Decepticons.

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:23.620
We will take over the Mother's will and make the Sabertron again ours.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.160
Oh, Lord Galvatron,

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.860
we are entrusting you to the Decepticons.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.480
Weardorff, don't act like you've gone too far!

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.840
You're still just a newcomer to the Headmasters!

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.970
No, I want to show them the true power of our Destron Headmasters!

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.170
Let's go!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:42.120
Wow!

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:49.850
What do you think you can do, you cowards?

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:51.370
Listen up, everyone!

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:52.340
Don't care about those three!

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:56.260
Go after the Autobots without leaving a single one behind!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.560
Leave it to me, Lord Galvatron!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.390
Let's go, Terratron!

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:01.830
Yes!

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:18.590
Is it good?

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.140
Yes, it's very good.

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:22.620
What is this?

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:31.910
What should we do?

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:33.690
