00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:36.650
We're in a good place, Spike.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:39.350
Look! There's a Decepticon!

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:41.510
A Decepticon?

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:46.880
