00:03:59.100 --> 00:03:59.640
Save the citizens!

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.840
I'm going to save Grimlock!

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:07.400
We're going too, Techbot! Lanceform!

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:19.790
Meanwhile, at the Ascenia Cybertron headquarters,

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:23.610
a strategy meeting was held with the Commander-in-Chief of the Convoy.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.480
Hound, what do you think? What happened to the Cybertron?

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.710
The energy of the Matrix...

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.100
Something must have happened to Vector Sigma because the Trilogy has been released.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.020
Something has happened to Vector Sigma?

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.800
That's not good. If Vector Sigma is taken away by Decepticons, it will be a big problem.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.040
No, it's just my guess.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.850
Hound, that guess may be a big hit.

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:45.650
Athenia, Athenia!

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:48.750
Hurry up and send reinforcements. Decepticons are on a rampage.

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:50.940
Send reinforcements to Earth as well.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.060
Yes, sir!

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:55.730
Spike, can you hear me? Slotrobot is heading towards Sabertron now.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.260
Send reinforcements to Earth as well, so don't worry.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:04:59.270
Roger that.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.360
Why don't you go to Athenia for the time being?

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:03.840
Yes, sir.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:06.560
Rodimus, I'm going to Sabertron.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.340
You stay here.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.570
Yes, sir.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:13.240
Meister, you go to Sabertron with the Chief.

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:20.320
At that time, Galvatron was angry at the unscrupulous battle of the subordinates.

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:24.830
What are you waiting for? Get out of here!

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.440
Do you think we're playing with Galvatron?

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:29.680
If this is the case...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:30.220
I'll use my hand.

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:33.160
I'll use my hand.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.420
I'll use my hand.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:37.000
I'll use my hand.

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:39.560
I'll use my hand.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.550
Huh? Something's wrong.

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:45.630
Grimlock is sleepy.

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:47.560
What?

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.880
The hand used by Wipe was a hypnotic technique.

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:53.870
How about my hypnotic technique?

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:55.630
Huh? What's wrong, Skull?

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:56.780
You fool!

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:58.480
