00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:05.870
On the other hand, at the Cybertron headquarters...

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:09.770
Hurry up, Spike. If Destron attacks, Athenia will be in trouble.

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:11.130
I knew it.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.050
Did you figure something out?

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.650
Vector Sigma is out of control.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:17.790
What? What do you mean? Explain it more clearly, Spike.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:23.420
Vector Sigma's balance has returned to its normal state, so Destron and the others have also invaded this Cybertron.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:28.520
That's not good. If that's true, it'll be a big deal. Hurry up and contact Combo.

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:29.540
Hey!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.800
We have to hurry!

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:33.120
The Decepticons are attacking the Space Bridge!

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:35.640
Okay, I'll be there soon.

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:37.130
I'll report back to Athenia.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.100
Let's do that.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:46.390
The Autobot army is trying to help the Autobots on Earth,

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:49.380
while the Decepticons are trying to stop them.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.820
