00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:27.160
Damn it!

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:37.960
Trainbot, hurry up and go to the Space Bridge!

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:39.260
Roger that!

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:43.220
