00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:14.090
Now, hurry!

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.120
I'll definitely defeat you next time!

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:26.970
That's it!

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:28.440
Alright, let's go!

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:40.490
And then the train bot will take off, right?

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:42.650
Don't be in a hurry, don't be in a hurry.

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:43.700
It's gone.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:45.000
All right, okay.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:56.000
When the reinforcements from Earth were launched,

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:59.000
The Sabertron was getting closer and closer to the greatest danger.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:06.940
Decepticons, you're rampaging like crazy!

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:07.920
Damn it!

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:13.700
Let's split up!

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:14.820
Yes, sir!

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:17.600
The Decepticons' attack continued.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:20.860
But the Autobots, along with the command of the Convoy,

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:23.410
