00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:28.880
The Trainbots, the Triplebots, and the Airbots also arrived.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:33.730
If we don't hurry, the Cybertron will take away our computer base!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:36.190
Hurry! Hurry!

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:40.580
At that time, Char and the others returned to the Hacenya base.

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:42.260
What?

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.940
Commander Convoy went to the Cybertron?

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:48.390
So you're saying we're back?

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:50.870
Yeah. They said they were investigating the Vector Sigma.

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:54.310
What did you say? Investigating the Vector Sigma?

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:56.300
That's right.

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:59.870
That's ridiculous! Commander Convoy and the commander...

