00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:37.680
I don't care if anything happens, but I have a bad feeling about this.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:38.260
What?

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:43.290
On the other hand, the Sabertron...

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:46.430
Wait, Daniel! Where are you going?

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:49.170
I'm going to the computer base. I'm going to investigate Vector Sigma.

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.500
That's impossible!

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:54.520
It's okay! You made it to the Sabertron!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:59.140
Who do you think made you come here?

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:28.630
Daniel, I don't think this is the place for you to come.

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:31.400
Do you want to go back to Earth?

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:32.010
No!

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:38.960
At that time, in Athenia...

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.610
We can't do anything about it.

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:43.520
No way.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.030
What's wrong, Char?

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:48.390
I remembered the nightmare 400 million years ago.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:50.340
400 million years ago?

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:52.900
The war back then was terrible.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:59.340
A part of the citizens were chased by the war and...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.180
