00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:11.960
On the other hand, in the Sabertron system...

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.840
Take this, you big bastard!

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:40.890
Chief! Leave this to me!

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:42.400
Hurry, Vector Sigma!

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:43.860
Don't talk nonsense! I can't let you kill me!

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:46.980
Chief! Leave this to us!

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.950
Yes, Triple Bot. I'm counting on you.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:05.530
At that time, the computer base was about to fall into the hands of the Decepticons.

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:08.250
Give up, you Autobots!

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:10.190
Do you want to all become scrap metal?

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:15.510
I'm Grimlock. Have you ever seen a new Decepticon?

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:19.780
That's right. I'm the Decepticon Headmaster, Weird Wolf.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.930
I'm Skull.

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:22.990
I'm Wipe.

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:25.540
