00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:32.590
I'm going to be a scum!

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:41.790
Leave the rest to me.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.020
I'm going to fold the mountain.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:50.520
I'm going to sleep. Good night, everyone.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:51.640
I'm going to fold the mountain.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:53.740
I'm going to sleep.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:58.450
I'm going to fold the mountain.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.400
I did it! My hypnosis is amazing!

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:09.700
Well done, Wipe! Now the Vector Sigma belongs to us!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.380
Garbato!

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:13.040
That's how you do it!

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:19.800
Who's there?

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:40.090
It's been a long time, Weird Wolf.

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:41.270
