00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:57.260
Weird Wolf, I'll settle this with you.

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:58.280
Prepare yourself!

00:18:58.520 --> 00:18:59.830
What are you talking about?

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.630
This is exactly what I want! I'll accept it!

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:06.400
The four Headmaster Warriors suddenly appear in the battle between the Autobots and the Decepticons.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:10.330
Who are they?

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:15.260
A new battle is about to begin in the Sabertron galaxy.

00:19:31.884 --> 00:19:32.164
Oh, wow.

00:19:38.572 --> 00:19:39.372
We'll be back.

00:19:39.788 --> 00:19:40.068
Thank you.
